00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.570
So what does that really mean?

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.320
What it really means
at the end of the day

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:43.110
is that they are leveraging
APIs as the front-and-center

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:47.160
mechanism of exploiting their
capabilities to a variety

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.000
