to get some benefit.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:04.410
Or it could also be a
big partner ecosystem

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:08.009
who are really deriving extended
value from these products.

00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:13.620
So these products in the new day
and age are nothing but APIs.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.650
And so if we look at
this picture real quick,

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:18.630
it talks about
your core systems,

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:22.560
such as the core
